@startuml system-context
title Link — System Context Diagram (C4 Level 1)

actor "Curator\n(authenticated user)" as curator
actor "Visitor\n(anonymous, no account)" as visitor

rectangle "Link\nURL organizer web app\n(Next.js + PostgreSQL,\nDockerized)" as link

cloud "Target Websites" as sites

curator --> link : HTTPS\nmanage folders & links,\ncreate/revoke share links
visitor --> link : HTTPS via share URL\n/read/<token>\nbrowse shared subtree read-only
link --> sites : GET http(s)\nOG/meta metadata scraping\n(SSRF-guarded)

note bottom of link
  Deployed via docker compose:
  - app container (Next.js standalone)
  - postgres container (volume-backed)
  Behind optional TLS reverse proxy.
end note

@enduml
